    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 1: Test with Development Tier (If Not Done)",
      "Anchor": "step-1-test-with-development-tier-if-not-done",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Test with Development Tier (If Not Done)"
      ],
      "Text": "If you haven\u0027t already:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 1: Test with Development Tier (If Not Done)",
      "Anchor": "step-1-test-with-development-tier-if-not-done",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 1: Test with Development Tier (If Not Done)"
      ],
      "Text": "Complete the Quickstart Guide\nTest OAuth flow and API calls\nValidate your integration works correctly",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 2: Request Lite Tier Upgrade",
      "Anchor": "step-2-request-lite-tier-upgrade",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 2: Request Lite Tier Upgrade"
      ],
      "Text": "Submitting the request typically takes only a few minutes. Follow the onboarding instructions provided by LinkedIn to complete the Lite tier upgrade process.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "2.1 Click Request Upgrade",
      "Anchor": "21-click-request-upgrade",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 2: Request Lite Tier Upgrade",
        "2.1 Click Request Upgrade"
      ],
      "Text": "Go to LinkedIn Developer Portal\nSelect your application\nNavigate to Products tab\nFind Verified on LinkedIn (should show \u0022Development Tier\u0022 status)\nClick Request upgrade",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "2.2 Accept Terms and Verify Email",
      "Anchor": "22-accept-terms-and-verify-email",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 2: Request Lite Tier Upgrade",
        "2.2 Accept Terms and Verify Email"
      ],
      "Text": "Review and accept Verified on LinkedIn Terms and Conditions\nVerify your business email address\nAn Access Request Form link will appear",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "2.3 Complete Access Request Form",
      "Anchor": "23-complete-access-request-form",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 2: Request Lite Tier Upgrade",
        "2.3 Complete Access Request Form"
      ],
      "Text": "Click the Access Request Form link and provide necessary details about your application, company, use case, and technical implementation.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "2.3 Complete Access Request Form",
      "Anchor": "23-complete-access-request-form",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 2: Request Lite Tier Upgrade",
        "2.3 Complete Access Request Form"
      ],
      "Text": "Tip",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "2.3 Complete Access Request Form",
      "Anchor": "23-complete-access-request-form",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 2: Request Lite Tier Upgrade",
        "2.3 Complete Access Request Form"
      ],
      "Text": "Be specific: Provide clear and detailed information about your application, company, and use case to help ensure a smooth onboarding experience.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "2.4 Complete the Upgrade Process",
      "Anchor": "24-complete-the-upgrade-process",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 2: Request Lite Tier Upgrade",
        "2.4 Complete the Upgrade Process"
      ],
      "Text": "Notification: You\u0027ll receive email once Lite tier access is enabled.\nStatus: Check the Products tab for the latest status of your upgrade.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Step 3: Configure Production Settings",
      "Anchor": "step-3-configure-production-settings",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 3: Configure Production Settings"
      ],
      "Text": "Once Lite tier access is enabled, configure your production environment:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "3.1 Verify OAuth Scopes",
      "Anchor": "31-verify-oauth-scopes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 3: Configure Production Settings",
        "3.1 Verify OAuth Scopes"
      ],
      "Text": "Ensure these scopes are authorized:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "3.1 Verify OAuth Scopes",
      "Anchor": "31-verify-oauth-scopes",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 3: Configure Production Settings",
        "3.1 Verify OAuth Scopes"
      ],
      "Text": "r_profile_basicinfo - Basic profile info\nr_verify - Verification status",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "3.2 Add Production Redirect URIs",
      "Anchor": "32-add-production-redirect-uris",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 3: Configure Production Settings",
        "3.2 Add Production Redirect URIs"
      ],
      "Text": "Go to Auth tab\nUnder Authorized redirect URLs, add your production URLs:\n\nhttps://yourdomain.com/auth/linkedin/callback\nhttps://yourdomain.com/oauth/callback",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "3.2 Add Production Redirect URIs",
      "Anchor": "32-add-production-redirect-uris",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 3: Configure Production Settings",
        "3.2 Add Production Redirect URIs"
      ],
      "Text": "Warning",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "3.2 Add Production Redirect URIs",
      "Anchor": "32-add-production-redirect-uris",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 3: Configure Production Settings",
        "3.2 Add Production Redirect URIs"
      ],
      "Text": "Only HTTPS URLs are allowed. HTTP URLs will be rejected.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "3.3 Secure Your Credentials",
      "Anchor": "33-secure-your-credentials",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 3: Configure Production Settings",
        "3.3 Secure Your Credentials"
      ],
      "Text": "\u2705 Store Client Secret in environment variables or secret manager\n\u2705 Never commit credentials to version control\n\u2705 Use different credentials for staging and production\n\u2705 Implement token encryption at rest",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "4.1 Update OAuth Flow",
      "Anchor": "41-update-oauth-flow",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 4: Deploy to Production",
        "4.1 Update OAuth Flow"
      ],
      "Text": "Your Development tier code will work with Lite tier. The only change is access scope:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "code",
      "Section": "4.1 Update OAuth Flow",
      "Anchor": "41-update-oauth-flow",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 4: Deploy to Production",
        "4.1 Update OAuth Flow"
      ],
      "Text": "// Same OAuth flow - now works for all LinkedIn members\nconst authUrl = \u0060https://www.linkedin.com/oauth/v2/authorization?response_type=code\u0026client_id=${clientId}\u0026redirect_uri=${redirectUri}\u0026scope=r_profile_basicinfo%20r_verify\u0026state=${state}\u0060;",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "4.2 Test with Real Users",
      "Anchor": "42-test-with-real-users",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 4: Deploy to Production",
        "4.2 Test with Real Users"
      ],
      "Text": "Have non-admin LinkedIn members test your integration\nVerify OAuth consent flow works correctly\nTest API calls return expected data\nVerify verification badges display correctly",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "4.3 Monitor API Usage",
      "Anchor": "43-monitor-api-usage",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 4: Deploy to Production",
        "4.3 Monitor API Usage"
      ],
      "Text": "Track your API usage to stay within rate limits:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "4.3 Monitor API Usage",
      "Anchor": "43-monitor-api-usage",
      "SectionPath": [
        "Step 4: Deploy to Production",
        "4.3 Monitor API Usage"
      ],
      "Text": "Application-level: 5,000 calls/day\nMember-level: 500 calls/day per member",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "4.3 Monitor API Usage",
